module 'External Displays' Output
author MicroBlocks
version 1 3 
description 'This library supports connecting selected external displays to MicroBlocks boards.

* Only selected display controllers are supported.
* The original micro:bit and Calliope mini boards do not support external displays.
* Color displays must be connected to the MicroBlocks SPI pins.
* OLED displays must be connected to the MicroBlocks I2C pins.
* RP2040 and RP2350 boards without WiFi do not support the Unicode font.
'

  spec ' ' '[tft:init7735]' 'attach ST7735 w _ h _ rotation _ #BR# dc pin _ cs pin _ backlight pin _ : #BR# reset pin _ invert colors _ BGR colors _ : #BR# xOffset _ yOffset _' 'num num num num num num num bool bool num num' 128 128 0 0 0 0 -1 false false 0 0
  spec ' ' '[tft:init7789]' 'attach ST7789 w _ h _ rotation _ #BR# dc pin _ cs pin _ backlight pin _ : #BR# reset pin _ invert colors _ BGR colors _ : #BR# xOffset _ yOffset _' 'num num num num num num num bool bool num num' 240 135 0 0 0 0 -1 false false 0 0
  spec ' ' '[tft:init7796]' 'attach ST7796 w _ h _ rotation _ #BR# dc pin _ cs pin _ backlight pin _ : #BR# reset pin _ invert colors _ BGR colors _ : #BR# xOffset _ yOffset _' 'num num num num num num num bool bool num num' 480 320 0 0 0 0 -1 false false 0 0
  spec ' ' '[tft:init9341]' 'attach ILI9341 rotation _ dc pin _ cs pin _ backlight pin _ : #BR# reset pin _ invert colors _' 'num num num num num bool' 0 0 0 0 -1 false
  spec ' ' '[tft:initOLED]' 'attach OLED w _ h _ : reset pin _' 'num num num' 128 64 -1
  spec ' ' '[tft:closeDisplay]' 'detach display'
